    <briefdescription>
<para>XSI STREAMS interface (&lt;<ref refid="stropts_8h" kindref="compound">stropts.h</ref>&gt;) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides the STREAMS I/O control interface (a legacy XSI extension). STREAMS is rarely implemented in its entirety; Zephyr provides minimal support for compatibility.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>STREAMS is an optional XSI extension to POSIX. Portable applications should avoid relying on it; use BSD sockets instead.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ulink url="https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/basedefs/stropts.h.html">POSIX.1-2017 &lt;stropts.h&gt;</ulink> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
